dates\n\n* fix(form-date): keep accessible description in sync\n\n* fix(form): restore native reset semantics for uncontrolled fields\n\n* fix(form-input): preserve controlled modifier drafts\n\n- retain intermediate number and trimmed input text\n- normalize drafts on blur\n- restore the controlled value when updates are rejected\n\n* fix(form): honor resets across uncontrolled controls\n\n- use native defaults for checkbox, radio, and listbox search inputs\n- synchronize group and toggle state after form resets\n- preserve post-reset change events and add browser coverage\n\n* fix: typecheck error","tree":{"sha":"47a1a743193606fe38afd8add27df86a1cee9d9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nocpiun/gitlab-ui-react/git/trees/47a1a743193606fe38afd8add27df86a1cee9d9a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nocpiun/gitlab-ui-react/git/commits/4c2c4a5cf485785b8b16e180944686873fdec35e","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqpAz7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA55IQALAmMpTfujQ/ZVyRzGJl2Cn5\nfzazSklXCk47HlUEalJq0SqRlSWAs9wGe7VRzlRbpHLbdJb0jsDUATjmCoOLxBwc\nZR0G/dbN/Goc8WtPcNeFg0m+i7gojCLnCJl1UHOLai6OLrIKbr6rixdOakGyHvcj\nGsvtzXWpZ7zmNFw6QsfGF+Ar/rvp/PV4saE/IM410RIQ8y5J5uPUvDCEhK1HGx7m\nyj4EjVYXKVmSexz62repxazEGlUAEa5VY/QVcYWcqkSsvOzLz6tVQTFJsq9qb4Ca\nFik9+zk94oDnQp6amgUaMlPl2Tn91EeKLpREriWj9ym2RkjeLbz0u5c4vxl+3KFH\n+0nFESLQH+5dFO9qdO0fDHyOUx+SnfUltLJUbycfPZy81HSP9jELALjcnijRViml\nUhoxZ7EducGNRfr1WGrJ2E59LzNHDgAwKyI80E8bPEfR5RX8QZQ+sYLNaDDz6pYK\nI4WiUexE8ZM4gTY/7CrL70azkM8avDsC8Zwo60e3PwG9sPYLXj+XIAiiYtcIANLN\n9lY1PI8SvfcPDeo8VGH8MA1SSCodFmPqqDwZ5702mgiryimx6KrJ80kPQUSTKv0B\nEVPZ3/DJ3mFjfF1TvRL11P69QdJt0GEc2n3Of/PBKEtkrt3E68X8thiOnoxOOQT3\neGZY9Wk7MgwEyMkEHtKk\n=mwYp\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 47a1a743193606fe38afd8add27df86a1cee9d9a\nparent 2930632d1e0967137ce53694e309654e1b5cb913\nauthor Norcleeh <Nriot233@outlook.com> 1789136123 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789136